          <h4>Translating CIDR Notation</h4>
          <p>
            Classless Inter-Domain Routing (CIDR) replaced the legacy classful address model. An <strong>ip subnet calculator cidr</strong> tool maps slash notation (like <code>/24</code> or <code>/28</code>) into corresponding subnet masks and usable boundaries in real time.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/kubernetes-subnet-planner" class="card-link">Verify CIDR parameters →</a>
      </div>

